	.string "Vai, mio super Pokémon Coleottero!$"

Route9_Frlg_Text_ConnerDefeat:
	.string "I miei insetti…$"

Route9_Frlg_Text_ConnerPostBattle:
	.string "Se non ti piacciono i Coleotteri, mi fai\n"
	.string "ronzare i nervi!$"

Route9_Frlg_Text_BriceIntro:
	.string "Ahahah! Che tipo tosto!$"

Route9_Frlg_Text_BriceDefeat:
	.string "Cosa?$"

Route9_Frlg_Text_BricePostBattle:
